@@ checks_bind
A failed check marked as ending the process contradicts every halts statement below, so a proof of one implies $that on every input it covers.
@@ checks_bind_some
A failure of $subject ends the process with a status that the halts statements below that name $that exclude, so a proof of one of those statements implies $that on every input it covers.
